{%- comment -%}
  ElmsNest v2 PDP — §4.6 "ארבעה מספרים, לפני שמשלמים."  ·  #env2-pdp-terms  ·  spine answer #6.

  The licensed consumer wording, sold as a virtue (graft H). A compact one-line strip already sits
  under the add-to-cart in §4.1; THIS is the full ledger — a 2-column hairline ledger, never four
  boxes across (do-not §6.2, and the v1 trust strip this replaces was exactly that).

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ where every word comes from
  Nothing here is a product claim, so nothing here reads a product field: the four numbers are the
  store's consumer terms, licensed wording preserved verbatim from snippets/elmsnest-pdp-facts and
  -trust (WINNING-SPEC §5 "copy the licensed wording into §4.6 first"), and the headings are graft H
  (BRIEF §3 "Consumer terms, findable on the PDP"). No new claim is written here, and no number on
  this page is derived from the product — so this section renders identically, and correctly, on all
  27 products: it touches no image index, no option, no variant and no metafield. `product` is used
  for exactly one thing, and only when it exists: the shared photo-CTA snippet names the product
  inside the prefilled mail body.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ the photo link (§4.7 mailto rule)
  settings.whatsapp_number is empty, so the "1 תמונה" row's link is a mailto. This section never
  builds that URL: it renders snippets/elmsnest-v2-pdp-photo-cta, the one place both branches live,
  which strips any WhatsApp claim a label might carry. A block that carries its own link_url gets a
  plain anchor instead; a block with no label at all renders no link.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ bidi
  Every digit-leading token of a headline or a sentence ("8–17", "1–3", "7–14", "29.90", "5%",
  "100") is wrapped in <bdi> at render time, so a range never flips to "3–1" inside the Hebrew
  sentence and the merchant can keep typing plain text. A slash pair stays inside ONE <bdi>,
  because the wrapper splits on spaces and never inside a token (§6.17).

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ no JS / reduced motion
  Everything is server-rendered text: with JavaScript disabled the four numerals are lit (the core
  sets --lit:1 unless html.env2-js), every sentence is present and the two link kinds are ordinary
  anchors. JS does exactly one thing — light the four numerals in reading order, 120 ms apart
  (§3.3) — which is why they are [data-lamp="manual"]: the core's shared observer skips manual
  lamps, except under reduced motion, where it lights all four at once with no transition.

  Plumbing: elmsnest-v2-core (from layout/theme.liquid) supplies the tokens, fonts, .env2-*
  helpers and window.env2. This section renders no global and owns no other snippet.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign digits = '0123456789'
  assign line_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'number'
-%}
<section id="env2-pdp-terms" data-env2-pdp-terms class="env2-section env2-pdp-terms" dir="rtl" style="scroll-margin-top:90px;--env2-stars:.55" aria-labelledby="env2-pdp-terms-h2">
  <div class="env2-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="env2-wrap env2-pdp-terms__wrap">
    <div class="env2-pdp-terms__head">
      <div class="env2-pdp-terms__title">
        {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="env2-eyebrow env2-pdp-terms__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h2 id="env2-pdp-terms-h2" class="env2-h env2-pdp-terms__h2">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      {%- if section.settings.deck != blank -%}
        <p class="env2-pdp-terms__deck">{{ section.settings.deck }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if line_blocks.size > 0 -%}
      <ol class="env2-pdp-terms__ledger" data-env2-pdp-terms-ledger>
        {%- for block in line_blocks -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            One pass over "headline ~~F~~ sentence": every word that starts with a digit becomes its
            own <bdi>. Built with append (never literal text) so Shopify's whitespace trimming can
            not eat the spaces, and split on '~~F~~' (not ' ~~F~~ ') so a blank headline still keeps
            the two halves aligned.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign pair_src = block.settings.headline | strip | append: ' ~~F~~ ' | append: block.settings.sub
            assign pair_out = ''
            assign words = pair_src | strip | escape | split: ' '
            for w in words
              assign c = w | slice: 0, 1
              if c != blank and digits contains c
                assign tok = '<bdi>' | append: w | append: '</bdi>'
              else
                assign tok = w
              endif
              if forloop.first
                assign pair_out = tok
              else
                assign pair_out = pair_out | append: ' ' | append: tok
              endif
            endfor
            assign pair_out = pair_out | replace: '</bdi> ₪', '</bdi>&nbsp;₪' | replace: '</bdi> %', '</bdi>&nbsp;%'
            assign halves = pair_out | split: '~~F~~'
            assign headline_html = halves[0] | strip
            assign sub_html = halves[1] | default: '' | strip
          -%}
          <li class="env2-pdp-terms__line" data-lamp="manual" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {%- if block.settings.numeral != blank or block.settings.unit != blank -%}
              <span class="env2-pdp-terms__n">
                {%- if block.settings.numeral != blank -%}
                  <bdi class="env2-pdp-terms__num">{{ block.settings.numeral }}</bdi>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if block.settings.unit != blank -%}
                  <small class="env2-pdp-terms__unit">{{ block.settings.unit }}</small>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <div class="env2-pdp-terms__t">
              {%- if headline_html != '' -%}
                <b class="env2-pdp-terms__b">{{ headline_html }}</b>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if sub_html != '' -%}
                <p class="env2-pdp-terms__p">{{ sub_html }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.link_label != blank -%}
                <p class="env2-pdp-terms__cta">
                  {%- if block.settings.link_url != blank -%}
                    <a class="env2-link env2-pdp-terms__a" href="{{ block.settings.link_url }}">{{ block.settings.link_label }} <span aria-hidden="true">&#8592;</span></a>
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- render 'elmsnest-v2-pdp-photo-cta', product: product, label: block.settings.link_label, class: 'env2-pdp-terms__a' -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </p>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ol>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.foot_links != blank -%}
      <nav class="env2-pdp-terms__foot" aria-label="עמודי מדיניות">{{ section.settings.foot_links }}</nav>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
/* ---------- §4.6 PDP terms: a 2-column hairline ledger — numeral, headline, sentence ----------
   Never four across (do-not §6.2): two columns on desktop, one on mobile, rows on hairlines,
   no box and no surface. The section paints no background: the ground is the body gradient from
   elmsnest-v2-ground-product (§3.1), and the only thing above it is the star layer. */
.env2-pdp-terms{padding-block:100px 110px}
.env2-pdp-terms__wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}

/* head: eyebrow + h2 at the start, the deck at the end, bottoms aligned (§4.6 graft H) */
.env2-pdp-terms__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,.95fr);align-items:end;gap:24px 48px;margin-bottom:44px}
.env2-pdp-terms__title{min-width:0}
.env2-pdp-terms__eyebrow{margin-bottom:20px}
.env2-pdp-terms__h2.env2-h{font-size:clamp(34px,4.9vw,72px);max-width:17ch}
.env2-pdp-terms__deck{justify-self:end;max-width:44ch;margin:0 0 .35em;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:300;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink-2);text-align:end;text-wrap:balance}

/* the ledger: 1fr 1fr, a hairline above every cell, and ONE continuous rule closing the whole
   ledger — so it stays closed whether there are four numbers, three, or the foot nav is empty */
.env2-pdp-terms__ledger{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:clamp(32px,4vw,64px);row-gap:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-pdp-terms__line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:22px;align-items:baseline;margin:0;padding-block:30px;border-top:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}

/* the numeral: FRL 500 tabular glow (§3.2 "terms numeral 72 / 48"), unit at .3em in ink-2.
   --lit is 0 only while html.env2-js has not lit this line yet; no JS and reduced motion = 1. */
.env2-pdp-terms__n{display:block;min-width:0;white-space:nowrap;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,72px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--env2-glow);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-shadow:0 0 34px rgba(255,211,148,.22);opacity:calc(.34 + .66*var(--lit,1));transition:opacity 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.env2-pdp-terms__num{unicode-bidi:isolate;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.env2-pdp-terms__unit{display:inline;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:400;font-size:.3em;line-height:1;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--env2-ink-2);margin-inline-start:.24em;text-shadow:none}

/* the term: the licensed headline, then the licensed sentence, then the optional link */
.env2-pdp-terms__t{grid-column:2;display:grid;gap:7px;min-width:0;max-width:44ch}
.env2-pdp-terms__b{display:block;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:500;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.env2-pdp-terms__p{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:300;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.env2-pdp-terms__p bdi,.env2-pdp-terms__b bdi{unicode-bidi:isolate}
.env2-pdp-terms__cta{margin:5px 0 0;line-height:1}
.env2-pdp-terms__a{font-size:14px;color:var(--env2-glow);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,211,148,.4);padding-bottom:2px;text-decoration:none;transition:color .3s,border-color .3s}
.env2-pdp-terms__a:hover,.env2-pdp-terms__a:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-ink);border-color:var(--env2-ink);text-decoration:none}

/* foot: the policy pages, quiet, hairline-underlined (richtext, one paragraph). 14px — the §3.2
   floor for an information-bearing line, not the 12.5px the homepage ledger uses for the same nav */
.env2-pdp-terms__foot{margin-top:24px;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:400;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--env2-mute)}
.env2-pdp-terms__foot p{margin:0}
.env2-pdp-terms__foot a{color:inherit;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(143,149,163,.4);padding-bottom:2px;text-decoration:none;transition:color .3s,border-color .3s}
.env2-pdp-terms__foot a:hover,.env2-pdp-terms__foot a:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow);border-color:var(--env2-glow);text-decoration:none}

/* ---------- mobile: one column, four rows, numeral 48px, 44px tap targets ---------- */
@media (max-width:900px){
  .env2-pdp-terms{padding-block:72px 64px}
  .env2-pdp-terms__head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;margin-bottom:26px}
  .env2-pdp-terms__eyebrow{margin-bottom:14px}
  .env2-pdp-terms__h2.env2-h{max-width:none}
  .env2-pdp-terms__deck{justify-self:start;text-align:start;max-width:none;margin-bottom:0;font-size:16px;text-wrap:pretty}
  .env2-pdp-terms__ledger{grid-template-columns:1fr;column-gap:0}
  .env2-pdp-terms__line{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;padding-block:24px}
  .env2-pdp-terms__n{font-size:48px}
  .env2-pdp-terms__t{grid-column:auto;max-width:none}
  .env2-pdp-terms__b{font-size:17px}
  .env2-pdp-terms__cta{margin-top:2px}
  .env2-pdp-terms__a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px}
  .env2-pdp-terms__foot{line-height:1.5}
  .env2-pdp-terms__foot a{display:inline-block;padding-block:13px}
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% javascript %}
/* §4.6 motion: "the four numerals light in reading order, 120 ms apart" (§3.3) — the ONLY thing
   this file does. The section is complete without it: every word is server-rendered and the core
   sets --lit:1 whenever html.env2-js is absent or reduced motion is on, so the numerals are lit.
   The lines are [data-lamp="manual"] so the core's shared observer leaves the stagger to us
   (it still lights them all at once under reduced motion, which is what §3.3 asks for).
   Ends with the CONTRACT's env2.observe fallback line. */
(function () {
  function init(el) {
    if (el.__env2PdpTerms) return;
    el.__env2PdpTerms = true;

    var lines = Array.prototype.slice.call(el.querySelectorAll('[data-lamp="manual"]'));
    var lightLine = function (l) {
      if (!l || l.classList.contains('lit')) return;
      if (window.env2 && window.env2.light) { window.env2.light(l); } else { l.classList.add('lit'); }
    };
    var lightAll = function (stagger) {
      lines.forEach(function (l, i) {
        if (stagger) { window.setTimeout(function () { lightLine(l); }, i * 120); } else { lightLine(l); }
      });
    };
    var rm = (window.env2 && window.env2.rm) ||
      (window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches);

    if (!lines.length) {
      /* nothing to stagger */
    } else if (rm || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
      lightAll(false);
    } else {
      var target = el.querySelector('[data-env2-pdp-terms-ledger]') || el;
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
        entries.forEach(function (en) {
          var tall = en.boundingClientRect.top < window.innerHeight * 0.6;
          if (en.isIntersecting && (en.intersectionRatio >= 0.25 || tall)) {
            lightAll(true);
            io.disconnect();
          }
        });
      }, { threshold: [0, 0.25, 0.6], rootMargin: '0px 0px -6%' });
      io.observe(target);
    }

    window.env2 ? env2.observe(el) : el.querySelectorAll('[data-lamp]').forEach(function (l) { l.classList.add('lit'); });
  }
  function boot(root) {
    var scope = (root && root.querySelectorAll) ? root : document;
    scope.querySelectorAll('[data-env2-pdp-terms]').forEach(init);
    if (scope !== document && scope.matches && scope.matches('[data-env2-pdp-terms]')) init(scope);
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () { boot(document); });
  } else {
    boot(document);
  }
  document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', function (e) { boot(e.target || document); });
})();
{% endjavascript %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ElmsNest v2 — PDP מספרים",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "כותרת עליונה קטנה", "default": "06 · אחרי הלחיצה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "כותרת", "default": "ארבעה מספרים, לפני שמשלמים." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "deck", "label": "שורת פתיחה (בצד השני של הכותרת)", "default": "לא אותיות קטנות. אותיות גדולות, במקום גלוי, ליד הכפתור." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "foot_links", "label": "קישורי מדיניות בתחתית", "default": "<p><a href=\"/pages/shipping-delivery\">משלוחים ואספקה</a> · <a href=\"/pages/processing-time\">זמני טיפול</a> · <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">מדיניות ביטולים</a> · <a href=\"/pages/help-faq\">שאלות נפוצות</a></p>", "info": "פסקה אחת עם הקישורים לעמודי המדיניות, מופרדים בנקודה." }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 4,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "מספר",
      "limit": 4,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "numeral", "label": "המספר הגדול", "default": "14", "info": "לדוגמה: 0 · 8–17 · 14 · 1" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "unit", "label": "יחידה (מוצגת קטן ליד המספר)", "default": "יום" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "headline", "label": "השורה המודגשת", "default": "ביטול עסקה לפי חוק הגנת הצרכן." },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "sub", "label": "משפט ההסבר", "default": "עד 14 יום מקבלת המוצר. דמי ביטול עד 5% ממחיר העסקה או 100 ₪ — הנמוך מביניהם.", "info": "מספרים וטווחים (למשל 1–3) נשמרים בכיוון הנכון אוטומטית. זהו נוסח משפטי — אין לקצר אותו." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "link_label", "label": "טקסט קישור (לא חובה)" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "link_url", "label": "יעד הקישור", "info": "ריק = הקישור לשליחת תמונה של המקום, לפי הגדרות הערכה (מייל היום)." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "ElmsNest v2 — PDP מספרים",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "number", "settings": { "numeral": "0", "unit": "₪", "headline": "משלוח לנקודת איסוף — חינם.", "sub": "שליח עד הבית: 29.90 ₪.", "link_label": "" } },
        { "type": "number", "settings": { "numeral": "8–17", "unit": "", "headline": "ימי עסקים מרגע ההזמנה ועד הדלת.", "sub": "1–3 ימי טיפול ועוד 7–14 ימי משלוח. חלק מהמוצרים נשלחים ממחסנים מחוץ לישראל.", "link_label": "" } },
        { "type": "number", "settings": { "numeral": "14", "unit": "יום", "headline": "ביטול עסקה לפי חוק הגנת הצרכן.", "sub": "עד 14 יום מקבלת המוצר. דמי ביטול עד 5% ממחיר העסקה או 100 ₪ — הנמוך מביניהם.", "link_label": "" } },
        { "type": "number", "settings": { "numeral": "1", "unit": "תמונה", "headline": "שלחו תמונה של המקום — נבדוק התאמה לפני שתזמינו.", "sub": "ואם המוצר לא מתאים, נגיד את זה.", "link_label": "לשלוח תמונה של המקום" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
